# Local visual-check harness for the design pass: renders a page with the REAL
# primitives via react-dom/server, inlines the built stylesheet and screenshots it
# headlessly, so a layout claim is checked against compiled CSS rather than reasoned
# about. Untracked because it is a workbench, not a build step.
